1
00:00:00,633 --> 00:00:04,000
Learn algorithms. Inside Minecraft.

2
00:00:04,033 --> 00:00:10,233
Algorithm Computer: 6 iron ingots, 2 redstone dust, 1 glass.

3
00:00:10,267 --> 00:00:13,733
Place it anywhere. Right-click to open your IDE.

4
00:00:13,767 --> 00:00:17,667
AlgoCraft: learn algorithms in Minecraft.

5
00:00:17,700 --> 00:00:21,567
Code without leaving the game.

6
00:00:21,600 --> 00:00:25,567
Prefer a big screen? Open the Web IDE.

7
00:00:25,600 --> 00:00:35,167
Write real Java.

8
00:00:35,200 --> 00:00:37,167
Run. Then Submit.

9
00:00:37,200 --> 00:00:39,100
Run checks the visible examples.

10
00:00:39,133 --> 00:00:41,067
Submit is judged by the server, hidden tests included.

11
00:00:41,100 --> 00:00:43,000
Accepted: 7 / 7 test cases passed.

12
00:00:43,033 --> 00:00:46,900
First clears pay off. Loot scales with difficulty and your gear.

13
00:00:46,933 --> 00:00:52,767
500 official problems: 172 Easy, 205 Medium, 123 Hard.

14
00:00:52,800 --> 00:00:56,933
Clear statements. Real diagrams.

15
00:00:56,967 --> 00:00:58,600
English and Simplified Chinese.

16
00:00:58,633 --> 00:01:06,400
Daily supplies from day 3. Two netherite ingots on day 14, four every week from day 28.

17
00:01:06,433 --> 00:01:14,200
Milestone rewards at 10, 25, 50, 100, 200 and 500 solves.

18
00:01:14,233 --> 00:01:18,100
And every achievement becomes a trophy.

19
00:01:18,133 --> 00:01:25,933
Five trophy tiers: bronze, silver, gold, diamond, netherite.

20
00:01:25,967 --> 00:01:29,833
Engraved with your name, the date and the feat.

21
00:01:29,867 --> 00:01:33,733
23 achievements to collect.

22
00:01:33,767 --> 00:01:45,433
Built for servers: one shared bank, judged on the server.

23
00:01:45,467 --> 00:01:53,233
In-game IDE, Web IDE, 500 problems, trophies.

24
00:01:53,267 --> 00:02:06,967
AlgoCraft for Forge 1.20.1 and NeoForge 1.21.1.
